      "title": "Just Eat UK Delivery Token",
      "type": "object",
      "x-credential-instructions": "Paste an existing UK Delivery as a Service bearer token issued to your partner account. NoClick reads your collection points to check the connection. Tokens expire; replace an expired token here. This is the delivery partner API, not a Just Eat consumer login or JET Connect API key.",
